exists su name author prompter ob text "Draft: be concise and friendly." be text ya
exists su name reviewer prompter ob text "Verify: return JSON with REASONING bullet points and SCORE PASS|FAIL." be text ya
exists su name author be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" accordingto name author prompter ya
exists su name reviewer be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" accordingto name reviewer prompter ya
exists su name duty ob text "Write a short greeting." be text ya
su name sketch ob name duty for name author to name text sketch recorder be write do
su name reviewer phrase ob name sketch recorder for name reviewer to name text reviewer recorder be write do
ob name sketch recorder be write do
ob name reviewer recorder be write do
